1
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,120
My lords, no formalities.

2
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:31,240
I've heard much of your country.

3
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,520
Now that I see it,

4
00:02:32,639 --> 00:02:34,039
it truly lives up to its reputation.

5
00:02:36,319 --> 00:02:38,360
At such a young age,

6
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,840
you're already an envoy to the capital.

7
00:02:40,159 --> 00:02:42,680
It speaks to your family's prestige.

8
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,159
Only in the capital

9
00:02:44,159 --> 00:02:46,080
can one witness such splendid performances.

10
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:52,639
Cheng Qi is the top scholar of Xingyun.

11
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:54,960
He is the finest poet of our nation.

12
00:02:55,479 --> 00:02:56,879
I hope

13
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,159
his speech tonight

14
00:02:58,240 --> 00:03:00,400
will satisfy you.

15
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,159
Besides the speech,

16
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,879
I heard there are other spectacles.

17
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,560
Of course.

18
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,240
The royal family shares joy with the people,

19
00:03:10,479 --> 00:03:11,520
and specially prepared

20
00:03:12,159 --> 00:03:14,759
a fireworks show for you,

21
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,759
waiting for your appreciation.

22
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,120
Thanks, Your Majesty.

23
00:03:19,199 --> 00:03:20,199
Thanks, Lord Prime Minister.

24
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:29,639
Brother,

25
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:31,560
I remember this barrel of gunpowder

26
00:03:31,879 --> 00:03:33,159
wasn't in this spot just now.

27
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,479
It wasn't.

28
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:44,159
Brother,

29
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:46,120
check all the barrels of gunpowder again.

30
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,039
The location,

31
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:47,879
number,

32
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:48,520
and authenticity

33
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:49,400
and authenticity.

34
00:03:50,879 --> 00:03:51,599
Don't be too obvious.

35
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:52,560
Understood.

36
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:55,159
If there's an issue, follow the plan.

37
00:03:55,879 --> 00:03:56,400
Okay.

38
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:00,719
My lady,

39
00:04:03,919 --> 00:04:05,159
the royals have entered.

40
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,840
How's it going with Qianzhi?

41
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:10,080
The fireworks have been moved.

42
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,479
Brother is checking them again.

43
00:04:11,479 --> 00:04:11,919
He'll be back soon.

44
00:04:25,319 --> 00:04:26,240
It'll take about 10 minutes.

45
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,279
Fine.

46
00:04:30,399 --> 00:04:31,759
You have more than 10 minutes.

47
00:04:34,839 --> 00:04:36,519
[They are so sweet.]

48
00:04:36,519 --> 00:04:37,639
[I'm looking forward to the play.]

49
00:04:37,639 --> 00:04:38,639
[I'm so envious.]

50
00:04:38,639 --> 00:04:40,120
[So sweet.]

51
00:04:46,079 --> 00:04:47,639
The mountains and rivers are boundless.

52
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:49,480
The clouds and the moon are a family.

53
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,519
Yunlang's play

54
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:54,439
starts now.

55
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:34,839
[The prosperous Jiangnan is famous for its rivers.]

56
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:37,959
[Yunjing is a city of talented people.]

57
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,720
[The lights are dazzling.]

58
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:42,360
[The mood is high.]

59
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,319
[The streets are crowded.]

60
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:46,759
[It's bustling.]

61
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:51,279
[Pavilions by the water.]

62
00:05:51,959 --> 00:05:53,480
[Carved balustrades and towers.]

63
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:56,279
[Music fills the streets.]

64
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:59,079
[Autumn osmanthus.]

65
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,680
[Peach blossoms for miles.]

66
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:04,839
[silk brocades in late spring.]

67
00:06:20,079 --> 00:06:22,279
Make sure you have plenty of rouge.

68
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:25,240
We have guests from the Langyue coming.

69
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,600
We must ensure they leave satisfied.

70
00:06:28,439 --> 00:06:29,959
The stationery set for the young master

71
00:06:29,959 --> 00:06:31,360
is what the distinguished guests love.

72
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,639
It must be a very good business.

73
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,319
[Red flying, green dancing,]

74
00:06:42,879 --> 00:06:44,560
[flowers and brocades everywhere.]

75
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:47,160
[Good news spreads to every household.]

76
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,839
♪ What are the long robes for ♪

77
00:06:50,079 --> 00:06:51,360
♪ A moment of lingering ♪

78
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,560
♪ Tourists talk ♪

79
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,600
♪ Laughing through life ♪

80
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:58,480
♪ Ten thousand homes lit with warmth ♪

81
00:06:58,879 --> 00:07:01,879
♪ Peace reigns across the world ♪

82
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:06,319
Good.

83
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,600
Follow the plan later.

84
00:07:18,759 --> 00:07:19,879
Once I make my move,

85
00:07:20,319 --> 00:07:21,759
you all charge out.

86
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,959
Guest from the Yun State,

87
00:07:29,079 --> 00:07:30,759
This is my best jade hairpin.

88
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:33,439
Take it back to your wife.

89
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:34,759
Thank you.

90
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,600
My friend from Yun State,

91
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,879
take a look at my gem.

92
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:46,279
May you find your beloved,

93
00:07:46,759 --> 00:07:49,360
and seek her across the world.

94
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,120
Next year's Lantern Festival night,

95
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:59,079
gold hairpins and jade will be in the clouds.

96
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:03,560
I've heard that the gems from Langyue are rare.

97
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:05,000
Once the two countries trade,

98
00:08:05,319 --> 00:08:06,199
you should

99
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:09,120
buy some for your wives.

100
00:08:10,839 --> 00:08:11,959
I've been

101
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:14,839
planning to make a fur shawl for my wife.

102
00:08:16,519 --> 00:08:19,720
I'm sure it'll be a unique experience

103
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:22,720
to visit Langyue.

104
00:08:23,399 --> 00:08:24,680
If you come to Langyue,

105
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:26,079
I'll give you a warm welcome.

106
00:08:28,079 --> 00:08:29,879
Thank you, Princess.

107
00:08:30,959 --> 00:08:33,080
Are you trying to take my good minister away?

108
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:34,679
That's not gonna happen.

109
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:35,919
I already have a husband.

110
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:36,799
Don't worry, Your Majesty.

111
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,200
I can

112
00:08:43,759 --> 00:08:46,840
accompany the Grand Preceptor to Langyue.

113
00:08:47,919 --> 00:08:49,200
After all, his mother's family

114
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:50,840
also has Langyue lineage.

115
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:52,519
It's like returning home.

116
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,399
Really?

117
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:58,399
If you have the chance to go to Langyue,

118
00:08:58,679 --> 00:09:00,799
I'll treat you to a feast.

119
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:04,039
Thank you, Princess.

120
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:05,799
Your Highness,

121
00:09:07,519 --> 00:09:09,559
this is the daughter of the Grand Preceptor,

122
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,559
the largest merchant in the Yun State.

123
00:09:12,159 --> 00:09:13,960
It's a good opportunity for you to meet her.

124
00:09:17,399 --> 00:09:19,720
When the Yun State's trade delegation visits,

125
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,799
she will likely be among them.

126
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,720
You can establish more connections.

127
00:09:26,799 --> 00:09:29,399
Your Majesty, I'm not in good health,

128
00:09:29,679 --> 00:09:31,600
and have already handed over my family's business.

129
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,039
I'm afraid

130
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,120
I'll let you down.

131
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:40,279
I wouldn't dare to do business with her.

132
00:09:40,759 --> 00:09:42,279
She wouldn't even let me

133
00:09:42,519 --> 00:09:43,320
read storybooks.

134
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,399
Lord Xiao,

135
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:50,799
who manages

136
00:09:50,919 --> 00:09:52,240
your fortune?

137
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,919
I can do business with that person.

138
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,519
Lord Xiao,

139
00:09:57,039 --> 00:09:58,399
do I know that person?

140
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,159
Well...

141
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,159
He...

142
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,720
[People gather from afar,]

143
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:15,120
[jade and pearls fill the market.]

144
00:10:20,159 --> 00:10:21,360
We can talk about business

145
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,120
later.

146
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,960
Don't miss the wonderful performance.

147
00:10:26,559 --> 00:10:28,120
[Flute melodies in the clear sky,]

148
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:30,080
[water lily songs at night.]

149
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,080
Yes, yes.

150
00:10:32,519 --> 00:10:36,559
[Banners and lanterns line the streets.]

151
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:38,559
The Emperor's thoughtfulness

152
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,080
has made this the finest banquet.

153
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,600
You live in the bright moon,

154
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,879
far from the hustle and bustle.

155
00:10:44,639 --> 00:10:46,000
You may never have seen

156
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,200
such a grand scene,

157
00:10:47,399 --> 00:10:49,080
that's why you're so excited.

158
00:10:49,759 --> 00:10:51,000
Watch your words.

159
00:10:51,159 --> 00:10:52,679
Watch your words.

160
00:10:53,559 --> 00:10:55,919
There are many good things in the bright moon you haven't seen.

161
00:10:56,519 --> 00:10:57,720
When trade opens up,

162
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,679
everyone will see them.

163
00:10:59,559 --> 00:11:01,000
Trade is the trend,

164
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:03,000
that no one can stop.

165
00:11:03,639 --> 00:11:04,480
Really?

166
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,039
Princess,

167
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:11,840
the fireworks you like are coming soon.

168
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:39,080
♪Clouds gathering as the rain stops.♪

169
00:11:39,879 --> 00:11:41,919
♪The Milky Way and the moon are round.♪

170
00:11:42,679 --> 00:11:45,519
♪The moonlight brings longing into the clouds.♪

171
00:11:48,399 --> 00:11:49,759
♪Clouds dance in the wind.♪

172
00:11:50,559 --> 00:11:52,159
♪The moon is coming.♪

173
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:23,360
Why did you suddenly change the music?

174
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,879
This is specially composed for you.

175
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,279
I want to perform it for you.

176
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:30,919
Come.

177
00:12:37,399 --> 00:12:38,159
My dear,

178
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,000
look,

179
00:12:39,639 --> 00:12:41,639
who are sitting in there?

180
00:12:43,759 --> 00:12:45,960
Who are they?

181
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:49,320
They are businessmen and common people from the Yun State.

182
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,320
I see them.

183
00:12:54,759 --> 00:12:55,720
My parents are there, too.

184
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,000
And over there,

185
00:12:58,919 --> 00:13:00,480
they are from the Langyue State.

186
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,240
That's great.

187
00:13:08,159 --> 00:13:09,039
Now,

188
00:13:09,679 --> 00:13:11,080
Yun and Yue are in close contact.

189
00:13:12,159 --> 00:13:12,960
If I want to

190
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,759
buy you a jade hairpin again,

191
00:13:15,159 --> 00:13:16,720
I don't have to go so far away.

192
00:13:32,759 --> 00:13:34,360
♪Thinking back to our first encounter,♪

193
00:13:35,679 --> 00:13:37,200
♪how many coincidences led us there.♪

194
00:13:39,159 --> 00:13:41,799
♪Hairpins and golden hairpins carry our secret messages,♪

195
00:13:43,919 --> 00:13:46,080
♪binding my life to yours, never to fail you.♪

196
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,120
So pretty.

197
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:06,519
Look at that one.

198
00:14:10,399 --> 00:14:11,679
That color is also pretty.

199
00:14:14,559 --> 00:14:15,360
Grand Preceptor,

200
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,919
you seem a bit confused.

201
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:20,759
It's so beautiful.

202
00:14:20,759 --> 00:14:23,679
Is the speech you received from the Imperial Study

203
00:14:24,519 --> 00:14:25,559
not like this?

204
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:26,679
This is just so beautiful.

205
00:14:45,919 --> 00:14:47,000
How wonderful!

206
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:49,879
Sincere,

207
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,000
and warm.

208
00:14:51,519 --> 00:14:52,840
Just like their love,

209
00:14:53,559 --> 00:14:56,600
It's like the picture of a couple

210
00:14:56,679 --> 00:14:58,159
in a million families.

211
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:03,399
We are like the mountains and rivers,

212
00:15:04,759 --> 00:15:06,279
clouds and moon,

213
00:15:17,399 --> 00:15:18,360
the heaven and earth,

214
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:20,399
and the crowd.

215
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:23,360
My dear,

216
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,559
this is my love for you.

217
00:15:34,279 --> 00:15:35,600
I love you

218
00:15:35,919 --> 00:15:36,720
in the same way.

219
00:16:18,679 --> 00:16:19,480
It's so beautiful.

220
00:16:22,559 --> 00:16:23,759
If you like it,

221
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,559
I'll give you a better one.

222
00:16:25,879 --> 00:16:27,840
I'm talking about their love.

223
00:16:28,039 --> 00:16:29,039
I can give you that too.

224
00:16:31,159 --> 00:16:32,399
The princess and the emperor's son-in-law

225
00:16:32,639 --> 00:16:34,200
are indeed a loving couple.

226
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:37,799
Zhang Xi Yun

227
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:40,919
The fireworks were originally placed in the palace.

228
00:16:42,399 --> 00:16:43,840
Why are they outside?

229
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:45,399
I thought

230
00:16:45,919 --> 00:16:47,600
I would have to break my promise to the princess.

231
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,480
Your Majesty,

232
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:52,960
it was my father's idea.

233
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:54,000
Shut up.

234
00:16:58,320 --> 00:17:00,399
My father was worried that the fireworks

235
00:17:00,679 --> 00:17:02,279
would endanger you and Princess.

236
00:17:02,879 --> 00:17:05,720
So he ordered me to put them outside.

237
00:17:06,519 --> 00:17:08,160
You are indeed thoughtful.

238
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,359
No wonder the Grand Preceptor

239
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:13,200
entrusted his life

240
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:14,559
to you.

241
00:17:16,079 --> 00:17:17,160
You flatter me.

242
00:17:33,599 --> 00:17:34,079
Your Majesty,

243
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:37,880
I want them to perform again at Langyue.

244
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:39,039
And take the fireworks with them.

245
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,079
Don't be so hasty, Princess.

246
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:50,079
I have to reward them first.

247
00:17:51,799 --> 00:17:52,920
Go to hell!

248
00:17:58,160 --> 00:18:01,079
Guard the Emperor!

249
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:05,920
The Su's Escort Agency, take your positions!

250
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:07,319
Evacuate the people in an orderly manner!

251
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:12,039
Don't panic!

252
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:23,279
Go!

253
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:41,839
The Yun people are indeed unreliable.

254
00:18:56,960 --> 00:18:59,640
I guess he wanted to say

255
00:18:59,960 --> 00:19:02,240
you're unreliable.

256
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:15,960
Protect me!

257
00:19:22,759 --> 00:19:23,400
Zhang Wuheng,

258
00:19:23,839 --> 00:19:25,200
do you want to rebel?

259
00:19:35,119 --> 00:19:36,359
So what?

260
00:19:37,839 --> 00:19:38,240
My lady,

261
00:19:38,599 --> 00:19:39,680
go save the emperor.

262
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:40,759
Don't worry about me.

263
00:19:40,759 --> 00:19:41,519
I can protect myself.

264
00:19:44,359 --> 00:19:45,559
Just fight!

265
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:06,559
Don't move!

266
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:09,319
Or I'll kill him!

267
00:20:09,319 --> 00:20:09,920
Don't move!

268
00:20:12,759 --> 00:20:13,559
Su Yuejiao,

269
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:16,319
Cheng Qi's life is in my hands.

270
00:20:16,359 --> 00:20:17,960
You have two choices now.

271
00:20:18,359 --> 00:20:18,960
Either

272
00:20:19,359 --> 00:20:20,519
you kill the official,

273
00:20:22,599 --> 00:20:23,240
or

274
00:20:23,440 --> 00:20:24,599
kill your husband.

275
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:27,160
I'll count to three.

276
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:28,359
Make your choice.

277
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:32,000
Three.

278
00:20:46,119 --> 00:20:46,839
Mr. Su,

279
00:20:47,319 --> 00:20:48,759
you can't kill the official.

280
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:54,680
Two.

281
00:20:56,799 --> 00:20:57,400
My lady,

282
00:20:58,640 --> 00:21:00,000
remember our agreement.

283
00:21:04,799 --> 00:21:05,920
If you don't act,

284
00:21:06,119 --> 00:21:07,440
I will.

285
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:24,680
Mr. Su.

286
00:21:53,759 --> 00:21:54,559
Qijia!

287
00:21:57,240 --> 00:21:57,839
Shoot!

288
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:18,079
Zhang Wuheng,

289
